      "title": "Major Events",
      "content": "<h3>Iran Tensions Escalate as Trump Threatens 'Permanent' Deal</h3>\n<p>Trump vowed a \"permanent\" Iran deal while his VP, Vance, declined to endorse strikes—Gulf attacks hit Bahrain, complicating diplomacy. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNUGEzcUdkaW9kYmFheHhDbzBMTG9PTnhmeGZwTzBURFA5amgtbEZRX1Z2WTVRZzRKV3Z5a09ObWVpMXFpMG83bWxvYngzZi1jOTJMWnJPVkN0V1FiTUxPTkdQYWVraW5hWVN0QXZ0SWtmSExMSmQ2cWtibmdrRFdKRTg4VFhDdw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Guardian</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNTGgwZTZaQWNtSzNpRDhQajRHRHFFTDhiVXczZmUtaFJiMVdTMFcwN1dWV053c1lGY2hiUnJrNnc3X1JoREFHLWNYTG52bVk5cXhMSDlCU2NkcDVCeWhQamZsX3JXdVBYdzJSdWQ1NDlKaTE4ZzIxc3U1SE1lcnhjdm45TmtHVzBMTmI4?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CBS News</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOTzltZHhpNzJyRTg4dE5kYUJSOUJ4azFWY2txckEtQUlGQVVfTEtIUUpWN3dHZWlocXlZWGFidVRIMjN3ZDM4d2xQWVZ0UFAxRm81TGFfbFNZRzMxTXJOemdzOHRNeWJOLXhEWF83a3N0a1hiR0FjbUE1eGZVX002eVpMNHJyX2JoVXp5bFdjcDJBYkhOWFE4a1AzN0hSRE1wTDFmNGxvaFR6TkR6bkd4a3FSSUU1anZp?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a></p>\n<h3>AI Market Wipeout Deepens Into S&amp;P 500 Correction</h3>\n<p>Tech and AI stocks plunged, with Anthropic's IPO turmoil capping a $4 trillion loss—the S&amp;P 500 entered correction territory as bubble fears spread. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOYWh6YUdkVkxHaVNudVdOOWlBM2ZjY3lMTS1rNEhfeVFETnRNVjBlMUt0ODVzRE1HQUxUdU85MXhJdWVfTnUtUnV1YS1mQjZ3QnNPc3RmZzk3RlNKRjNDdVByMUgwcEI1TFY1WUk4cVlXVWlwOE5WMWZSUUc1Q3FnMjVNRUNZMUVjRE5FMmZtbng1ekVZ?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Business Insider</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fox Business</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQWUlOVXBkQS1POEJDU2lQekREZ25RVTczblRnSVg0M2lCeGFKT1Jad2t2ZDVhWm5SNmNxRnJmWWx3eUZzeHRqNTRSX0U4d05BUms4Z2ExeVpNWjdsWHd3RnR6OFBENVpFSGRaYWRad2E2V1NQZGlWRUViX3JIUTIzSGpEWEw3aV9FZ2MtbFRPeGZqNGJwVXQtYUxn?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a></p>\n<h3>Ukraine Strikes Crimean Bridge Third Time in Week</h3>\n<p>Drone attacks on Russia's Baltic cargo ship and repeated Kerch Bridge strikes signaled widening war, with Finland warning of spillover. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPaUFLdlZmeWprX3A2YllLMmlQSXZrYTRIazVMOEExREZuTXFCYThyVUlnR3U0TDg3dGpUeHE5SHJyanJWQUZTRHdwUG5YYTFxVXMtUU5rY1pOVzZkRUxhQ29oUEVUS0NJTWFxcUJmLW9lRE52cGs3N2FLbXZzNmVFNFpXTmZNZnI4S1pWNDB5RWV0UFhUUGlCTVUwNjlWZDMxcXhxS0FvZUdNNWN4UU9jMEw4bWVaOVB0TlE?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE94cXdVVUc1b3ZQMTdhdXdRUWF4RFVlNTNMYlJDeWxoR0NZX3hxd3BBOEJwTzhYdDJMQnZNRkZ4TDc3c0pTN3hyX0xBbkVUanpHejhWQUJKMzR2VEE?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BBC</a></p>\n<h3>Myanmar Found Guilty of Genocide by ICJ</h3>\n<p>In a landmark ruling, the UN's highest court held Myanmar responsible for genocide against Rohingya; rights groups urged sanctions. <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PBS</a></p>\n<h3>Storms Threaten Thanksgiving Travel on Both Coasts</h3>\n<p>Millions faced disruption as powerful storms targeted the East and West coasts, with rain, snow, and an atmospheric river forecast. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQQmxsSmsyUk1zQTI4aGZBcHlQUVpfa1FDY0c3endISlE3QmNLY0t2bjNVaUxQSWl1WFBPZFI4Wk9PTzRvMTAxdVo3eDZuaTJnX2RFQ0Vob1dHXzU2cWJGWndYWUhibklxV0lDOFlPS3U1cFVoeUU1MmRyVGVaZDZHZTZ2dV8?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NPR</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxORFNuaWVYNHRYbUJMR0t2RFh3SDZHdkxoczVFTEZpdkVubU1vT1E0cktrRm95cDRNTHJiR3hLYUNlMUdSTXNkdzlLdVRURXE3NkoxTVVDaUo0N3F5N04wRzA0OGRLVHE0RUEtZHBnbGtNd19SVTQ5dVlPYlBuQW5OcnphUkFWREc0eWp2MDIwTWJVWUdQc3FZVk83WFFiZw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gothamist</a></p>",
