      "id": "political-news",
      "title": "Political News",
      "content": "<h3>Global Flashpoints</h3>\n<p>President Trump said he seeks a \"permanent\" deal with Iran, warning the next move may not come until 2027 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNTGgwZTZaQWNtSzNpRDhQajRHRHFFTDhiVXczZmUtaFJiMVdTMFcwN1dWV053c1lGY2hiUnJrNnc3X1JoREFHLWNYTG52bVk5cXhMSDlCU2NkcDVCeWhQamZsX3JXdVBYdzJSdWQ1NDlKaTE4ZzIxc3U1SE1lcnhjdm45TmtHVzBMTmI4?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CBS News</a>. Iran widened Gulf attacks, hitting a Bahraini industrial facility and shipping in the Strait of Hormuz <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOTzltZHhpNzJyRTg4dE5kYUJSOUJ4azFWY2txckEtQUlGQVVfTEtIUUpWN3dHZWlocXlZWGFidVRIMjN3ZDM4d2xQWVZ0UFAxRm81TGFfbFNZRzMxTXJOemdzOHRNeWJOLXhEWF83a3N0a1hiR0FjbUE1eGZVX002eVpMNHJyX2JoVXp5bFdjcDJBYkhOWFE4a1AzN0hSRE1wTDFmNGxvaFR6TkR6bkd4a3FSSUU1anZp?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPbmRRX05leU91eDNOcGU0ZjVxQ0N2MVpwQ3lCZXFsNUVDcDlySkJ5RFZfLTR5QkwyUF91TzFkSDNpYTlPMzZTaFhfWmJ4TEpKTVAzTEJhNGVYRFltRmRMVDJfdUVpcFoyYnRRRGNEX3ZKRU96bjVxYjZEQ2V0WWFZOXhDb3dTT2FfTGpVTWtjX1JLeVpXUzN3OFlSdm5DdXJ1YzlHSnNJa3pjT0FDX3c?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WSJ</a>.</p>\n<p>Russia faced new fallout: Denmark accused it of an assassination plot <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOM1hTby15U1dTTGJnTEZPZ283Tm1jZG9aQnI1aGQ3MnJCaWNnbFN6Q0ZTdkhFZVM3LTY1ZEV2UEhkQkh0UGFJVHhNNUtfQ3M5VDVxQ2twQmpsbVVDdzk1b3NzWnRMTzA3SDF4WFZxUXhNWUwwMkNNZzFTejdQbEYxR3MtT3VHMk4yQzQ3S1M1eHJmREJCR3U4QWtPdXluNWprbWc?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CBS News</a>, and a drone strike set a Russian cargo ship ablaze in the Baltic Sea <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPaUFLdlZmeWprX3A2YllLMmlQSXZrYTRIazVMOEExREZuTXFCYThyVUlnR3U0TDg3dGpUeHE5SHJyanJWQUZTRHdwUG5YYTFxVXMtUU5rY1pOVzZkRUxhQ29oUEVUS0NJTWFxcUJmLW9lRE52cGs3N2FLbXZzNmVFNFpXTmZNZnI4S1pWNDB5RWV0UFhUUGlCTVUwNjlWZDMxcXhxS0FvZUdNNWN4UU9jMEw4bWVaOVB0TlE?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a>. A strike on Zelenskyy's hometown killed two and wounded scores <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPdEdyR1RJcnpvbkdBNFFKbHQ3bWh2SzBfVnBfdklPRGlubDVuZjVOYUVrTUtaVGNQc2ZtM042TmpvWFNUZU1vNlRDeUhWbS0xUU5IWndHdlNZa3JIYm1OQm55YVNvbVpxaUhBNExXbS1NOU91ODdGa2d4elRXOWhIUXZCRHR5T3ZTei1fRWRyOVJvOXJRSXNIM25QT1JIOXFPa2VTcg?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AP News</a>.</p>\n<h3>Washington &amp; Law</h3>\n<p>The White House cyber director was ousted after tech outages <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPcnZfZEZ3aEtxRXVIaGNXSi01azBiX1F6dUF1U1dUaWdNM05fSTBOd3lXUXAwWFZCdnZZRmJvX2dCT3dFNmdIckJ2U3IzZml0VGV0MWltUFBxY3hhZ3RRN1dXa0Q5YlozalVTaUZTR1JKNlBpOXpvWXNTcGZzdmNaOVYwNjA4dGctTmUwbEU5ei1NdFpWRkk5TFpWWE1oUThzcUxKMw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">KOMO</a>. The California State Bar is investigating ex-press secretary Katie Zacharia <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Hill</a>.</p>\n<h3>The Hague &amp; Beyond</h3>\n<p>The ICJ found Myanmar guilty of genocide against the Rohingya, prompting rights groups to urge sanctions <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PBS</a>. UN talks on \"killer robots\" fell short of binding rules <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE1yS2ZzRlFmaTlWY082V1hMc0VGNHVBWkUzWW53eVhnaEp6SnVic0RPdloxY1EtN2xnY0xXVzlQbkZVWjdONmlHaFh1MVRjTWNGbFhJU3ZiRGEwMlVwQmpfbTRVNXhoT214THotUTNyWlFPRFFTTmZz?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NPR</a>.</p>",
