      "title": "Financial News",
      "content": "<h3>Markets in Freefall as AI Wipeout Deepens</h3>\n<p>The S&amp;P 500 entered correction territory, with the Nasdaq erasing its 2026 gains <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQWUlOVXBkQS1POEJDU2lQekREZ25RVTczblRnSVg0M2lCeGFKT1Jad2t2ZDVhWm5SNmNxRnJmWWx3eUZzeHRqNTRSX0U4d05BUms4Z2ExeVpNWjdsWHd3RnR6OFBENVpFSGRaYWRad2E2V1NQZGlWRUViX3JIUTIzSGpEWEw3aV9FZ2MtbFRPeGZqNGJwVXQtYUxn?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. Nvidia stock plunged 14%, down 35% from its high, marking its longest weekly losing streak since 2008 <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Motley Fool</a>. The \"AI unwind\" has escalated, Goldman Sachs warns, watching for three bottom signals <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOWElreEFzaFE1QnFoaU1hSW50bzh5aXAtZnRSclhUMGY0WFFKOGo3YUJPZ05BR3lGeVpIMXZyQ3RVOURMLU8xNEw1aVo0NnFkZjRIbVRRWXd4UVpkU05PV2lTM1FNUnBwa3NYS3FyOWgzV2JVc0VEZEtkUUtianY3bDMwcGtkN2NoXzA2Y2JfUVRTYXNSLVo4UGw0ZEdMSEY1YWx0VWxHWG93V1J2V3FHTmdLRW1BenBob0NsZk1n?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fortune</a>. Bitcoin collapsed below $57,000, a two-year low <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQZ3l4RFFsS191QTB1b2VicGdIRlZESmozTURmT2NKbUFiMU5qVUZIcDdFM0ctV3p6Vmgwc2JoYi16WFh2dGxkTERLTHE5aW9jcmRHaF9uVGd4QXJFcHUyVzRndVRQTmZwcFZZbV9pWlFlNGZVNVNhWWp5MmQ3ckh0ZF8wTGRxeHZ0dUs0ZDN4SktpRVBCc1JqWEZsQVVJOXgzbFdBOUx1V011TEJGNENwbDIxNA?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bloomberg.com</a>. The turmoil follows Anthropic’s troubled IPO, which capped a $4 trillion AI market wipeout <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fox Business</a>. Nvidia faces an SEC accounting probe <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE5qSmxMVy1SN0NxMVRKNy1XTmdKbUJ0WVI4VlUwM3RQWnJvNkE0M1pLVVk3bHJZUUtYWUFJdUJjMllKbXhyYzNOR1dDazVJN2ZmaGxENktCS213Q29Vc2paREMxOEZGZkw5QzNHcU5KRjJxdVBjdHM2SlpR?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The New York Times</a>; CEO Jensen Huang resigned amid allegations of abusive behavior <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPV0JDWklpVUExWmNhdU8tNWJGV0V0R3hodC1JMHBRUm0zUFl6Qjk3SXlKX21yWjlrOUJXMVFMSDdmT1FJc0VBMnpCQy0tYVQ3TlNvX3VqMnBvT0w3WXRyMi16RFlNV1A1ZlNVM21RZUUtZG1la0g2R3luQmFEdnJBaFV2bHRvTVppekR3dEY4T2tWOEdxVnRGdUJuN2pYcGNkN2VHYjI4a3NQMFJmQ0RrVFdCdnV0RUd6QmlCam93?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kotaku</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxORnU4MHkxSU5DSkRlWkdZbGJaQXppeUJwckVueDN2V3A4bjFkaW5KMzhFSm42dmRPTkZqWVE1WnRIWjJwcU94TjMtNDJIWDRYTENIMVU1ZDhFbnVXWXdITjEyMjZuMlJXb2tnQlNKbWdPcjYzelN4R0RMWkIyWTJhX3p2VlJPR1JwTXhYSTFqUQ?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Business Insider</a>.</p>",
