      "id": "tech-news",
      "title": "Tech News",
      "content": "<h3>GTA VI Shatters Records, Sparks Global Mania</h3>\n<p>Grand Theft Auto VI passed $3 billion in first-day sales, among the biggest entertainment launches ever <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNYjhEYkRqdG81LV9ZZm9ScHRKYTUybnFBc3NHOWQ2dTFCZURHem9fMWVKWklZMXRvNTlodjgyWm5Ca0NfLXFZWEFOdVl2LTdmODRmVXV0WERkNklXM0hPMnRha3ExS1FNS0cwM0FBcVJDbzVoS01ib3N4Wm92YWJHSUdTTVFyaUcweXVoTUU4Y2N4WHB3d0hqSktqWTRXSi1pMUs0amI3eWJwdGVUWVhjWDBHRm1tZVcyS0IwMkl5Q1BzYTNt?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBC News</a>. Critics praised it, but user scores on Metacritic fell to 5.6 against a 99 metascore amid review bombing <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPbGQ2OU1Ob3Q3MGFabENFU1BBT1d5RnlvcUsxeUlIR0hZSkZidTR6czJYRXBzZVQ1VFdiS2JLRzc0YW03SXpMdVFNaEpKWC1JREZONHdZSks3ckFQbjR5NmpwNFpuR25sNGd6Y0VtZlMtYzdyekVKMXE3V2tkeDhtRTR5c2MwY05KVHNQeWV3aGdleWVmbHdlb2pRM0NnV0lLV0RDZlZwMUV5UmxNNGhhZlFsbw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Push Square</a>, with fan celebrations going viral <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNMURIZzFLbHdmUjJTVHBHcmxaQUcwWENlMXdacUVSVmZjWmx4TGsyV1BDeklUaWRKLVNEMHJHNjdLODdXczVlb0gwTHJfWm5Bb2JiYkVQcVpDMDZCS3pfdkZPMGt5VzBXdkNSM3MteXFHa1U2LTNvLU1NenQyb05valZXOGo0UWF6Mm9CTWwyOF82dXM3bS01VDdwcXhZV0ZIQ2ZMLVJFbTNUeTBLcEtGUldjRWhDUGFCOVhtdlJRZ3g4ajQ?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bleacher Report</a> and authorities issuing real-world safety warnings <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOUzRwakQ3WXVWRHpPdEFTWmV5MkNkaEVTWkJsVkUyOF9jdHFqSWx0U2hJbEp3OGIzUjNqam1fcU1qaWZDTU14Wk9XM2d1Y3ZSYktmaTVOMW55cWJhNHYyT0JBSUF2eVVaZzU2Wkwwb2wtTVp0c04xSFRVNVlfZi13QTdtMWZycVBCNDZtb3lpenFrLUhJRHFlUVRVeGplVUJ0bWgxRVpR?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Independent</a>.</p>\n<h3>Signal Blocks Screenshots to Thwart AI Surveillance</h3>\n<p>Signal restricted screenshots on iPhone and Android, citing an “existential threat” from AI agents reading private chats <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE1DS1dVTG4zUV9FMjlUODhpM3RkSHc1U29NM0pFSV9CWHFGTjZsS0hXM1Y4dkdubVNYRjA5REd4dWp6ajVDaXJqR20wWGE0T1dnSDNDcXdaRWs2QjdVYjZlaE96N2dETllPRWtxOWRaLWtzRGc?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mashable</a>. The move blocks AI-powered agents from extracting message content via screen captures.</p>\n<h3>Samsung Eyes Dynamic Island-Style Interface</h3>\n<p>Leaked One UI 9.5 beta suggests Samsung's Galaxy S27 will adopt an iPhone-like Dynamic Island feature for its Now Bar <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOd1lzR29nMFFOTm83ZmEtMU1NeG5nUVJzX3ZsZllWaVlrOWVYLUdBRWRhbWxxSDI1Y0RDa1o5Y3p0V0gtb09ZWGdoWjdhZWZXWjZ5VTVqYXdHWjl6a2VRMmY2UFlEeDRzdmhQb05nNVR5OUFLS0tnaGJ1WkwtTGUwam5EQQ?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">9to5Google</a>.</p>\n<h3>D&amp;D Publisher Shares AI Settlement with Authors</h3>\n<p>Wizards of the Coast will pass its full share of Anthropic's AI copyright settlement to D&amp;D writers <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOdHU1UW5rMGZQcVMzb1daVlJZaFR6UGdXQ1dHTUNkdlFFeGpiTnE2clFtaW1nN0RTcjl1NWNXN09tZG5rMVR0eHhmSUQxTks2cF9vbXBRRDZWNmRqSVk2QUJoZmQ5aUFsVHdUaERZSEs3Sm1PYjRlMldpenpNODlKZTJwTDlOc0VLRnZFdGQ2ZWlLTWo2a09aQ1Bwbw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Polygon.com</a>.</p>",
      "order": 3
    },
