      "id": "entertainment-news",
      "title": "Entertainment News",
      "content": "<p><em>The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping</em> debuted to a massive $120 million, the fourth-best series opening <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNSjV1WU02bzM3RXprY1AyeHVFc2JPWjBRM0NEODBXdFFIeXI3XzYyRW9rVk90SVpFQ1lzS2g0NTZQR0NqTG83VzU0U0FIN054NmlGcWlmbTlpYmV4TlVSR04tQzFEdVQ4VV9NUXBlMXN3a19HZ21mWnJRMm5YRi0yX29iTDdBUnBtazNTY0xKQ0pPdU9zQk00aXllVXBoMnl0QVpmRGl0Q3NhUVM4NE9jTA?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Variety</a>. Catherine, Princess of Wales, revealed in her documentary <em>Heal</em> that \"cancer does change you\" <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQV2hORVpjT3h1UjFyeWdhMFg2dEFaSHJiV1oySmxpUWpFNlBZcWlzQTVsbWthaVRPODdwWnVMYXBXUG0xNXEzenFVazRpNU00a0l4cDJ3MWRwaFJvTE45VEttR2ZCb0w4SC1UVnV0SFhVcHo5X1hwQjNnRGhxMEs5MHQ0czcxSmdnc2tXbnMxZGpTQlk?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CBS News</a>. Netflix’s <em>Minimum Wage</em> is ushering in streaming’s short-episode sitcom era <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNTHhIRTBxbXU5Q3EyTDdPWjZOTEVVYjF6SzdPdlVHVWNVV01TU0xUcFRPUnJ1ZFNpWlFpY0R1d2NZOVYzTGFreklJdXd0eDQ0bXpHVFpiWVdpcGJfNW9JQjRaY2paeXVtY3haUUtGQjA2NWg2R0J0cHVQQWhpZnJiY1JxM1E?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deadline</a>. Finally, <em>Yellowjackets</em> creators confirmed the final season was \"meant to be the final end\" <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOdFdjSElJc19PXzA5c3I4QmZYNmYyZ0xVUjhYc0JfU21qdHJZd1ZzWTFtMXZIY0swUXM2VzJRY3lHY0RtWWRVMzhRVHJMVG1QQk8wSVBRU3FVVUc3OHVVaTBRd0lac0kwSE1iZHlqSDVMMGlxdVRHVUxJX2U2VEFTSG40VWpHVlNhYXZubExZZlY2TUtpa0dFNWl1MXgyeDNlUTVTNk5PejJPejlVRGVWRDhrd0Y?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Hollywood Reporter</a>.</p>",
