    {
      "id": "sports",
      "title": "Sports",
      "content": "<h3>Basketball</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cleveland Cavaliers 128, Indiana Pacers 119</strong> — James Harden posts his 26th 50-point game, moving past Kobe, in an NBA Cup win <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/game/_/gameId/401909307/pacers-cavaliers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Denver Nuggets 133, Houston Rockets 124</strong> — Nikola Jokic’s big second half, with 26 points and 11 assists, fuels the win; Rockets coach Ime Udoka calls the defense “as bad as I’ve seen it” <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/game/_/gameId/401909312/rockets-nuggets\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a> <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/50549254/ime-udoka-frustrated-rockets-defense-loss-nuggets\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a> <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nba/recap?gameId=401909312\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Los Angeles Lakers 106, Sacramento Kings 104</strong> — Luka Doncic scores 25 as the Lakers survive after coach JJ Redick ripped their lack of fight at halftime <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/game/_/gameId/401909313/kings-lakers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a> <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/50547994/jj-redick-half-rant-fuels-lakers-last-place-kings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Football</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Oregon Ducks 45, Michigan State 7</strong> — No. 14 Oregon routs the Spartans to keep playoff hopes alive <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/college-football/game/_/gameId/401858529/oregon-michigan-st\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Baseball</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mets, A.J. Ewing reach 8-year, $95M extension</strong> — The 22-year-old center fielder commits to New York <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/mlb/story/_/id/50552088/mets-aj-ewing-reach-8-year-95m-extension-sources-say\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Yankees cut Luis Gil</strong> — The former AL Rookie of the Year is among 44 non-tendered free agents <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/mlb/story/_/id/50545849/yankees-cut-gil-24-al-rookie-year-tender-deadline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
