      "id": "stock-analysis",
      "title": "Stock Analysis",
      "content": "<h3>IPOs</h3>\n<p>Recent pricings include GM <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>, Guerrilla RF <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GUER\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>, Zoar <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ZOAR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>, Anthropic <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ANT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>, F &amp; M Bank <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FMBM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>, and Cizzle Brands <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CZZL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. Upcoming listings: ProShares Ultra/UltraShort Anthropic and Clywedog Therapeutics on Nov 23 <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ANTU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a> <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ANTY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a> <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CLYD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>; Quantum Space on Nov 24 <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/QSPC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>\n<h3>Major Indices</h3>\n<p>S&amp;P 500 fell 3.70% to 6,910.39; Nasdaq dropped 5.28% to 22,617.73 <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. Dow lost 1.93%; Russell 2000 slid 2.76% <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. VIX spiked 26.20% to 35.89 <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>\n<h3>Sectors</h3>\n<p>Technology led declines, down 7.27% <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. Consumer Staples gained 0.67%, the only advancing sector <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>\n<h3>Major Stocks</h3>\n<p>Nvidia plunged 14.01% to $125.53; Broadcom fell 12.19% <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. Tesla dropped 7.64%; Meta lost 5.93% <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>\n<h3>Notable Movers</h3>\n<p>Top gainers: Gap +11.4%, Global Payments +9.9% <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GAP\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a> <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GPN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. Top losers: IREN -18.0%, Applied Digital -17.8% <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IREN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a> <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/APLD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. Most active: Nvidia, Anthropic -8.5%, Intel -8.0% <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a> <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ANT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a> <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/INTC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>\n<h3>Rates &amp; Commodities</h3>\n<p>10-year yield fell 2.77% to 4.91% <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>. Oil rose 0.93% to $83.98; gold dropped 4.62% to $3,515.40; bitcoin slid 5.01% to $58,798.98 <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
